@startuml Text_to_BPG_Transformation_Algorithm
!theme aws-orange
title Алгоритм преобразования текстового описания бизнес-процессов в BPG
skinparam linetype ortho

' --- Глобальные параметры шрифта ---
skinparam defaultFontColor Black

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
  BorderColor #4169E1
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  FontColor black
}

start

partition "📋 Phase 1: Text Analysis & Entity Extraction" #LightBlue {

  :📄 Input Business Documents;
  note right
  • SOP documents
  • Process descriptions
  • User manuals
  • Training materials
  • Interview transcripts
  • Existing workflow diagrams
  • Domain-specific terminology lists
  end note

  :🤖 LLM Entity Recognition;
  note right
  LLM Prompting Strategy:

      System: You are a business process analyst expert.
      Analyze the following business documentation and extract:

      1. ENTITIES (actors, objects, processes, containers, controls)
         - Name, type, role, attributes

      2. RELATIONSHIPS (connections between entities)
         - Source, target, relationship type, cardinality

      3. PROCESSES (business workflows and patterns)
         - Name, description, inputs, outputs, steps

      Format: Structured JSON with confidence scores.
      Context: [Domain-specific context here]
  end note

  :📊 Extract Structured Data;
  note right
  JSON representation of extracted entities, processes, relationships
  end note
}

partition "🏷️ Phase 2: Template Matching & Categorization" #LightGreen {

  :🔍 Entity Category Matching;
  note right
  Сопоставление извлеченных сущностей с шаблонами категорий
  end note

  :📊 Calculate Matching Confidence;
  note right
  Пример псевдокода для оценки семантической схожести:
      for entity in extracted_entities:
          best_template = find_best_match(
              entity.description,
              entity_category_templates,
              similarity_threshold=0.7
          )
          confidence = calculate_semantic_similarity(entity, best_template)
  end note
}

partition "🔗 Phase 3: Relationship Inference" #LightYellow {

  :🧠 LLM Relationship Suggestion;
  note right
  Предложение связей между сущностями на основе контекста
  end note

  :📋 Template-based Relationship Discovery;
  note right
  Алгоритм сопоставления с шаблонами:

      def find_relationship_templates(entity1, entity2):
          category1 = entity1.category
          category2 = entity2.category

          # Direct template lookup
          direct_relations = template_db.query(
              source_category=category1,
              target_category=category2
          )

          # Semantic similarity search
          similar_relations = vector_search(
              query_embedding=encode(f"{category1} {category2}"),
              collection="relationship_templates",
              top_k=5
          )

          # Combine and rank
          return rank_by_relevance(
              direct_relations + similar_relations,
              business_context
          )
  end note

  :🎯 Relationship Type Classification;
  note right
  Informational, Transactional, Hierarchical, Temporal, Conditional
  end note
}

partition "⚙️ Phase 4: Process Pattern Discovery" #LightCoral {
  :📊 Pattern Template Matching;
  :🔍 Multi-level Pattern Recognition;
  :🤖 LLM Pattern Analysis;
  note right
  Уровни распознавания паттернов:

  Level 1: Atomic patterns (CRUD, Search, Navigation)
  Level 2: Composite patterns (E-commerce flow, User registration)
  Level 3: Domain patterns (Healthcare, Finance, Education)
  end note
}

partition "🏗️ Phase 5: Graph Construction" #Lavender {
  :📊 Create Enterprise BPG Structure;
  :🔗 Build Relationship Network;
  note right
  Создание слоев сущностей, паттернов и рабочих процессов.
  Связывание предсказанных отношений с оценкой доверия.
  end note
}

partition "✅ Phase 6: Validation & Refinement" #PaleGreen {
  :🔍 Consistency Validation;
  :👥 Expert Review Integration;
  :📊 Confidence Assessment;
  note right
  Проверка логической согласованности, соответствие бизнес-правилам, интеграция отзывов экспертов, расчет общей уверенности.
  end note
}

partition "📚 Phase 7: Knowledge Base Enrichment" #Moccasin {
  :🔄 Template Updates;
  :💾 Knowledge Base Storage;
  note right
  Обновление глобальной и корпоративной базы знаний с проверенными расширениями.
  end note
}

stop

legend right
Key Success Factors:

1. Multi-modal Validation
   • Template matching + LLM + expert review
2. Incremental Learning
   • Continuous template refinement, domain pattern discovery
3. Quality Assurance
   • Automated consistency checks, expert validation
4. Scalability
   • Modular architecture, efficient similarity search, cached results, parallel processing
end legend

@enduml
